{"id":"942c41e472f56c72","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-prime-ideal.md","title":"Prime Ideal Theorem","display":"thm-prime-ideal — Prime Ideal Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-prime-ideal","aliases":["58-thm-prime-ideal","Prime Ideal Theorem","Boolean Prime Ideal Theorem"],"display":"thm-prime-ideal — Prime Ideal Theorem","depends_on":["[[./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-prime-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-prime-ideal</span><span>Prime Ideal Theorem</span><span>Boolean Prime Ideal Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prime-ideal — Prime Ideal Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ea17c91dcff1011\" href=\"?note=6ea17c91dcff1011\" title=\"./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md\">58-df-axiom-of-choice.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\">\\(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6ea17c91dcff1011\" href=\"?note=6ea17c91dcff1011\" title=\"./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md\">58-df-axiom-of-choice.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{AC}_S\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land 0\\ne1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists I\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl(\n0\\in I\\land 1\\notin I\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee b\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\wedge a=b\\to b\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge b\\in I\\to a\\in I\\lor b\\in I)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{AC}_S\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land 0\\ne1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists I\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl(\n0\\in I\\land 1\\notin I\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee b\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\wedge a=b\\to b\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge b\\in I\\to a\\in I\\lor b\\in I)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>结论中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是任意非平凡布尔代数上的真素理想；这里没有误用仅适用于幂集代数的素理想谓词。</li>\n<li>PIT is equivalent to compactness for propositional logic and to the Boolean ultrafilter theorem.</li>\n<li>Halpern-Levy (1971): PIT strictly weaker than AC.</li>\n<li>AC implies PIT, but PIT does not imply full AC.</li>\n<li>Applications: Boolean-valued models, forcing, topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md","status":"resolved","id":"6ea17c91dcff1011","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md","status":"resolved","id":"6ea17c91dcff1011","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$（see [[./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6$（see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{AC}_S\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land 0\\ne1\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\exists I\\subseteq B\\;\\Bigl(\n0\\in I\\land 1\\notin I\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a\\vee b\\in I)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(b\\wedge a=b\\to b\\in I)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge b\\in I\\to a\\in I\\lor b\\in I)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":1415,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4372","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-thm-prime-ideal.md|58-thm-prime-ideal]]（batch14）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-238","locations":